T*
(superior fuel.) Tj
T*
(* Ultimate Analysis \(Chemical elemental determination\):) Tj
T*
(- Carbon and Hydrogen: Determined by combustion in Liebig train; CO2 absorbed in) Tj
T*
(KOH tubes, H2O absorbed in anhydrous CaCl2 tubes.) Tj
T*
(- Nitrogen: Determined via Kjeldahl digestion with concentrated H2SO4; liberated) Tj
T*
(NH3 titrated against standard acid.) Tj
T*
(- Sulfur: Precipitated as BaSO4 using Eschka mixture.) Tj
